      en: ["Total length of approximately 1,000 kilometers", "Flows through the central Congo Basin", "Joins the Lomela River to form the Busira", "Primary transport route in a region with no road access", "Historical center of the wild rubber trade", "Hosts an extremely high diversity of primate species"],
