      en: ["Surface area of approximately 5,120 square kilometers", "Forms the international border between Zambia and the DRC", "Mainly fed by the Luapula River system", "Drains via the Luvua River into the Congo River", "Reached by David Livingstone in 1867", "One of the most productive fishing grounds in Africa"],
